@title Cabinet: a plan made before rails ran through the device middles lists its devices as off the rail's middle
@area Cabinet
# qa/fixtures/door-cutouts.novo was made before rails ran through the middle of their devices, so its devices sit on the rail's line by their top edge. The Cabinet view counts them as problems, the pill names them and the Place all hint, and the Inspector says it for the selected device. The example project (rails through the middles) shows none of this.
open qa/fixtures/door-cutouts.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
shot old-plan
click_text " problems"
wait 10
expect "off the middle of its rail"
expect "run Place all"
shot problems-named
check_layout
key Escape
wait 3
click 627 190
wait 10
scroll 1190 500 -900
wait 5
expect "off the middle of its rail"
shot inspector-line
check_layout
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text issues
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
expect "off the middle of its DIN rail"
shot check-list-row
